<h2>Pomegranate export pricing</h2>
<p>Pomegranate prices move with harvest volumes, count-grade availability and reefer freight rates — a 400g+ grade in a short season prices very differently from mid-count fruit at peak. We quote current FOB or CIF prices against your specified count grade and destination port, with a stated validity window.</p>

